@startuml
title Fishbone Analysis - RabbitCare Gap Analysis Refinement v1.2
left to right direction

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam rectangle {
    RoundCorner 12
    BorderColor #64748B
    FontColor #1E293B
    BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2

rectangle "PEOPLE" as People
rectangle "Owner may submit incomplete booking details\nAdmin review workload may delay decisions\nStaff digital skill levels vary\nResponsibility for decision updates may be unclear" as PeopleCause

rectangle "PROCESS" as Process
rectangle "Owner request and admin approval workflow may be inconsistent\nCapacity must be revalidated before approval\nPending slot hold and expiry policy is unresolved\nVisit, service execution, invoice, and payment statuses may be mixed" as ProcessCause

rectangle "TECHNOLOGY" as Technology
rectangle "Baseline includes Owner-initiated booking, but does not model a pending-request review queue\nNo explicit capacity revalidation at an Admin approval step\nNo documented server-side gateway callback verification\nBooking and payment exception handling are not fully specified" as TechnologyCause

rectangle "DATA" as Data
rectangle "Owner and rabbit records may require duplicate-record controls\nMedical history may be fragmented across service activities\nBooking request and Admin decision metadata are not explicitly modeled in baseline\nBooking, Visit, Service Execution, Invoice, and Payment references may be difficult to trace" as DataCause

rectangle "MANAGEMENT & MEASUREMENT" as Management
rectangle "Operational indicators are not explicitly consolidated across lifecycle stages\nBooking decision time and no-show indicators may be unclear\nPayment reconciliation measures are not specified in the baseline model\nService-level performance indicators may need clearer definitions" as ManagementCause

rectangle "ENVIRONMENT & EXTERNAL SERVICES" as Environment
rectangle "Internet or hosting may be unavailable\nGateway or notification provider may fail\nProvider callbacks may be delayed or duplicated\nStaff schedules may change after request submission" as EnvironmentCause

rectangle "CORE PROBLEM\nThe baseline model does not define one consistently traceable\nworkflow across Owner booking, clinic decisions, service delivery,\nbilling, payment outcomes, and follow-up information." as Problem

note bottom
  This fishbone is a hypothesis-based analysis derived from the
  available repository models and documents. Potential causes
  require stakeholder interviews or field validation before being
  presented as confirmed operational findings.
end note

People --> PeopleCause
PeopleCause --> Problem
Process --> ProcessCause
ProcessCause --> Problem
Technology --> TechnologyCause
TechnologyCause --> Problem
Data --> DataCause
DataCause --> Problem
Management --> ManagementCause
ManagementCause --> Problem
Environment --> EnvironmentCause
EnvironmentCause --> Problem
@enduml
